{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dff2aab5-d7ce-80c5-920e-d28744594c12",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T11:39:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:42-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about a vital record. First, I need to know how to request a copy by mail. Second, how long it takes. And third, what I need to include."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to walk you through it. Which record are you looking for, a birth certificate, marriage, death?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:35:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A birth certificate. Mine. I was born in Newport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So for a mail request, you'd send a written request with your full name as it appears on the record, your date of birth, and the names of your parents, including your mother's maiden name. Then a copy of your photo ID, and a check or money order for the fee, and a self-addressed stamped envelope helps too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, one second. I only have one bar of service in this room. Can you hear me alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. You're a little quiet but it's coming through. Want me to go slower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. Let me just confirm. First, the written request with my name, birth date, and parents' names. Second, a copy of my ID. Third, payment by check or money order. Fourth, the envelope."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:36:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. You've got it. And make the payment out to the City of Newport, if you're sending a check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Now, the turnaround. How long does it take once you receive it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:36:33-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it depends a bit on the mail and how busy we are, but generally we process mail requests within a little over a week once it lands on our desk. Then add the mailing time on the way back. So I'd tell people to plan on a couple of weeks all in, to be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple of weeks. Okay. Is there a faster way, if I needed it sooner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Coming in person is usually the quickest. If you bring your ID, we can often help you while you wait. But if you're not close by, the mail works fine, it's just slower."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:37:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm local, actually. What are the hours for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:37:28-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open during regular City Hall business hours, weekdays. I'd say come in the morning if you can, it tends to be quieter before lunch. We're still in the morning right now, so if you wanted to head over today you'd have time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I might do that. Just so I have it right, I'd need my photo ID and payment, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, your ID and a way to pay. Bring the details about your parents too, in case we need to confirm the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Last question. If I mail it and something is missing, will someone call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you put a phone number on your request, yes, we'll try to reach you. Otherwise it could get sent back, and that adds time. So definitely include a number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then I'll include my number. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-five. That's the kind of thing that saves everybody a headache."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:38:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's everything. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Moira. Good luck with it, and if you do come in, just ask for the vital records window. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
